title: "disslucc"
abstract: >-
  Land use and land cover change (LUCC) modeling, raster-only,
  script-first, on top of dissmodel. Continuous (CLUE) and discrete
  (CLUE-S) allocation, validated against the original TerraME
  reference on real data.
